{title: Ae Maalik Tere Bande Hum}
{artist: Lata Mangeshkar Do Aankhen Baarah Haath}
{key: G#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[G#m] [D#],        Aye Maalik Tere Bande Hum
[E] [D#],        Ayese Ho Humaare Karam
[G#m],        Neki Par Chale Aur Badi Se Tale
[D#] [G#m],        Taanki Hasate Huye Nikale Dam
[G#m],        Ye Andhera Ghana Chha Raha
[F#] [G#m],        Tera Insaan Ghabara Rahaa
[D#m] [F#],        Ho Rahaa Bekhabar,
[D#m] [F#],        Kuchh Naa Aataa Najar
[D#m] [G#m],        Sukh Ka Sooraj Chhoopa Ja Raha
[G#m] [D#],        Hai Teree Roshanee Mein Jo Dam
[E] [D#],        To Amaawas Ko Kar De Poonam
[G#m],        Badaa Kamajor Hain Aadamee,
[F#] [G#m],        Abhee Laakhon Hain Is Mein Kamee
[D#m] [F#],        Par Too Jo Khadaa,
[D#m] [F#],        Hain Dayaaloo Badaa,
[D#m] [G#m],        Teree Kirapaa Se Dharatee Thamee
[G#m] [D#],        Diyaa Toone Humei Jab Janam
[E] [D#],        Too Hee Zelegaa Hum Sab Ke Gam
[G#m],        Jab Julmon Kaa Ho Saamanaa,
[F#] [G#m],        Tab Too Hee Humei Thaamanaa
[D#m] [F#],        Wo Buraee Kare,
[D#m] [F#],        Hum Bhalaaee Bhare,
[D#m] [G#m],        Naheen Badale Kee Ho Kaamanaa
[G#m] [D#],        Badh Uthhe Pyaar Kaa Har Kadam
[E] [D#],        Aaur Mite Bair Kaa Ye Bharam
